  {% when 'about-us', 'about' %}
    <h2>About Books Bunny</h2>
    <p>Books Bunny is an online bookstore built for readers who want it all in one place — fiction, non-fiction, children's books, poetry, educational titles, and more, sourced from publishers across India and beyond.</p>
    <p>We believe finding the right book shouldn't mean hopping between ten different websites. Books Bunny brings together titles from a wide range of publishing houses onto a single, easy-to-browse platform, so readers of every age and interest can discover, compare, and order books with ease.</p>
    <p>Every title on Books Bunny is 100% original and sourced directly through authorised channels. We do not list pirated, counterfeit, or unauthorised copies of any book.</p>
    <h3>What We Offer</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>A curated, wide-ranging catalogue spanning multiple publishers and genres.</li>
      <li>Reliable delivery across India, with select international shipping.</li>
      <li>Support for bulk and institutional orders for schools, libraries, and organisations.</li>
      <li>A simple, secure ordering and payment experience.</li>
    </ul>
    <h3>Our Promise</h3>
    <p>Every book on Books Bunny is sourced with care, and every order is handled with the same attention we'd want as readers ourselves. We're committed to fair dealings with publishers and authors, transparent policies for customers, and a shopping experience that puts books first.</p>
    <h3>Contact Us</h3>
    <p>Email: <a href="mailto:sales@unboundscript.com">sales@unboundscript.com</a><br>Phone: <a href="tel:+918743060284">+91-8743060284</a><br>Address: 2/41 Ansari Road, Daryaganj, Delhi – 110002</p>

  {% when 'privacy-policy', 'privacy' %}
    <h2>Privacy Policy</h2>
    <p>Books Bunny values your privacy and is committed to protecting your personal information. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your information when you interact with our website, services, or other interactions.</p>
    <h3>1. Information We Collect</h3>
    <p><strong>Personal information:</strong> full name, email address, phone number, and address when you contact us, place an order, or engage with our services.</p>
    <p><strong>Non-personal information:</strong> browser type, operating system, IP address, visit time, and pages viewed.</p>
    <h3>2. How We Use Your Information</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>To process orders and manage delivery.</li>
      <li>To respond to inquiries and provide customer support.</li>
      <li>To send important updates, newsletters, or promotional materials.</li>
      <li>To improve the website experience and comply with legal obligations.</li>
    </ul>
    <h3>3. Sharing Your Information</h3>
    <p>We do not sell or rent your personal information. We may share information with service providers, publishers fulfilling orders, courier partners, legal authorities where required, or as part of a business transfer.</p>
    <h3>4. Data Security and Your Rights</h3>
    <p>We use reasonable safeguards to protect personal information, though no internet transmission is completely secure. You may request access, correction, opt-out from promotional communication, or deletion subject to legal requirements.</p>
    <h3>5. Third-Party Links and Changes</h3>
    <p>Our website may include links to third-party or publisher websites. We are not responsible for their privacy practices. We may update this policy from time to time, and continued use of the platform indicates acceptance of the updated policy.</p>
    <h3>Contact Us</h3>
