  {% when 'shipping-policy', 'shipping' %}
    <h2>Shipping Policy</h2>
    <p>At Books Bunny, we are committed to delivering your orders efficiently and on time. Please review our shipping policies below to understand how we handle domestic and international shipping.</p>
    <h3>1. Shipping Locations and Charges</h3>
    <p>We offer shipping within India and to selected international destinations. Domestic standard shipping is free for orders above ₹500; a flat fee of ₹50 applies below ₹500. Express and international shipping charges may vary by location, weight, and courier service.</p>
    <p>International import duties, taxes, and other fees are the customer's responsibility and may be collected by the destination country upon delivery.</p>
    <h3>2. Processing and Delivery Time</h3>
    <p>Orders are dispatched within 3–4 business days, excluding weekends and holidays. Domestic standard delivery usually takes 5–7 business days from dispatch; express delivery usually takes 2–3 business days. International delivery typically takes 7–21 business days from dispatch.</p>
    <h3>3. Tracking and Address Accuracy</h3>
    <p>Once dispatched, you will receive email or SMS tracking details. If you do not receive tracking within 48 hours of dispatch, contact us. Customers are responsible for accurate and complete shipping information.</p>
    <h3>4. Failed Delivery, Lost, or Damaged Shipments</h3>
    <p>If delivery fails due to an incorrect address or recipient unavailability, re-delivery may be attempted. If a package is returned, reshipping charges may apply. For lost or damaged shipments, contact us within 7 days of the expected delivery date so we can work with the courier partner on replacement or refund.</p>
    <h3>Contact Us</h3>
    <p>Email: <a href="mailto:sales@unboundscript.com">sales@unboundscript.com</a><br>Phone: <a href="tel:+918743060284">+91-8743060284</a><br>Address: 2/41 Ansari Road, Daryaganj, Delhi – 110002</p>

